  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Faceless God — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You have learned the reversal of your technique. Rather than destroying the mind with madness and corruption, you strengthen it with wisdom and rationality. As an action for 6 CE, you activate your reversal for 2 minutes. You and creatures of your choice within 30 ft that can see you gain immunity to the charmed and frightened condition, resistance to psychic damage and advantage on mental saving throws. You cannot have Face of Wisdom and Madness Inducement active at the same time.</p>",
